        "sections": [
          {
            "section_type": "content",
            "normalized_html": "<p>In this lesson, we&#x27;ll extend our knowledge of absolute value. </p>",
            "readable_text": "In this lesson, we'll extend our knowledge of absolute value.",
            "images": [],
            "free_entry_blanks": [],
            "select_lists": []
          },
          {
            "section_type": "content",
            "normalized_html": "<p>Let&#x27;s first remind ourselves of the rules of absolute value:</p>",
            "readable_text": "Let's first remind ourselves of the rules of absolute value:",
            "images": [],
            "free_entry_blanks": [],
            "select_lists": []
          },
          {
            "section_type": "content",
            "normalized_html": "<ul><li><p><span class=\"math\">[MATH: |{-a}| = |a|]</span></p></li><li><p><span class=\"math\">[MATH: |a \\cdot b| = |a| \\cdot |b|]</span></p></li><li><p><span class=\"math\">[MATH: \\left| \\dfrac{a}{b} \\right| = \\dfrac{|a|}{|b|}]</span></p></li></ul>",
            "readable_text": "- [MATH: |{-a}| = |a|]\n- [MATH: |a \\cdot b| = |a| \\cdot |b|]\n- [MATH: \\left| \\dfrac{a}{b} \\right| = \\dfrac{|a|}{|b|}]",
            "images": [],
            "free_entry_blanks": [],
            "select_lists": []
          },
          {
            "section_type": "content",
            "normalized_html": "<p>Recall that the last two rules are known as the <strong>distributive properties.</strong></p>",
            "readable_text": "Recall that the last two rules are known as the distributive properties.",
            "images": [],
            "free_entry_blanks": [],
            "select_lists": []
          }
        ],
        "images": [],
        "free_entry_blanks": [],
        "select_lists": [],
        "readable_text": "Content:\nIn this lesson, we'll extend our knowledge of absolute value.\n\nContent:\nLet's first remind ourselves of the rules of absolute value:\n\nContent:\n- [MATH: |{-a}| = |a|]\n- [MATH: |a \\cdot b| = |a| \\cdot |b|]\n- [MATH: \\left| \\dfrac{a}{b} \\right| = \\dfrac{|a|}{|b|}]\n\nContent:\nRecall that the last two rules are known as the distributive properties."
