          {
            "section_type": "example_question",
            "normalized_html": "<p>Simplify the expression <span class=\"math\">[MATH: |{-3z}|-5\\cdot|4z|.]</span></p>",
            "readable_text": "Simplify the expression [MATH: |{-3z}|-5\\cdot|4z|.]",
            "images": [],
            "free_entry_blanks": [],
            "select_lists": []
          },
          {
            "section_type": "content",
            "normalized_html": "<p>EXPLANATION</p>",
            "readable_text": "EXPLANATION",
            "images": [],
            "free_entry_blanks": [],
            "select_lists": []
          },
          {
            "section_type": "example_explanation",
            "normalized_html": "<p>Firstly, since <span class=\"math\">[MATH: |{-a}| = |a|,]</span> we can write our expression as</p><p><span class=\"math\">[MATH: |3z|-5\\cdot|4z|.]</span></p><p>Then, we distribute the absolute value over the multiplication, and simplify:</p><p><span class=\"math\">[MATH: |3z|\u2212 5 \u22c5|4z||=;|3|\u22c5|z|\u2212 5 \u22c5|4|\u22c5|z||=; 3 \u22c5|z|\u2212 5 \u22c5 4 \u22c5|z||=; 3 \u22c5|z|\u2212 20 \u22c5|z||=; 3|z|\u2212 20|z||=; \u2212 17|z|]</span></p>",
            "readable_text": "Firstly, since [MATH: |{-a}| = |a|,] we can write our expression as\n\n[MATH: |3z|-5\\cdot|4z|.]\n\nThen, we distribute the absolute value over the multiplication, and simplify:\n\n[MATH: |3z|\u2212 5 \u22c5|4z||=;|3|\u22c5|z|\u2212 5 \u22c5|4|\u22c5|z||=; 3 \u22c5|z|\u2212 5 \u22c5 4 \u22c5|z||=; 3 \u22c5|z|\u2212 20 \u22c5|z||=; 3|z|\u2212 20|z||=; \u2212 17|z|]",
            "images": [],
            "free_entry_blanks": [],
            "select_lists": []
          }
        ],
        "images": [],
        "free_entry_blanks": [],
        "select_lists": [],
        "readable_text": "Example Prompt:\nSimplify the expression [MATH: |{-3z}|-5\\cdot|4z|.]\n\nContent:\nEXPLANATION\n\nExplanation:\nFirstly, since [MATH: |{-a}| = |a|,] we can write our expression as\n\n[MATH: |3z|-5\\cdot|4z|.]\n\nThen, we distribute the absolute value over the multiplication, and simplify:\n\n[MATH: |3z|\u2212 5 \u22c5|4z||=;|3|\u22c5|z|\u2212 5 \u22c5|4|\u22c5|z||=; 3 \u22c5|z|\u2212 5 \u22c5 4 \u22c5|z||=; 3 \u22c5|z|\u2212 20 \u22c5|z||=; 3|z|\u2212 20|z||=; \u2212 17|z|]"
